### Amoruso Pass Dashboard - API Ingressi Test Suite

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### ================================
### 0. HEALTH CHECK - Verifica che il server funzioni
### ================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ================================
### 1. GET - Lista ingressi (senza filtri)
### ================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ingressi
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ================================
### 3. GET - Statistiche ingressi
### ================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ingressi/stats
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ================================
### 4. GET - Test con errore validazione
### ================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ingressi
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "email-non-valida",
  "ragione_sociale": "Test SRL",
  "targa": "AB123CD",
  "importo": 25.50
}

### ================================
### 5. GET - Ricerca ingressi
### ================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ingressi/search?q=amoruso&limit=5
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ================================
### Se non funziona ancora, test del middleware
### ================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ingressi/cmb6zl54o00018zktdtweume8
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: REST-Client-Test


